<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 15px 0; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f4f4f4; font-weight: bold; }
        .overdue { color: #d32f2f; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <p>Dear {{CustomerName}},</p>
    
    <p>This is a friendly reminder regarding your overdue invoice(s).</p>
    
    <!-- Apex will add the full table here -->
    
    <p>Please make the payment at your earliest convenience to avoid further delays.</p>
    
    <p>If you have already made the payment, please ignore this email.</p>
    
    <p>Thank you for your prompt attention.</p>
    
    <p>Best regards,<br>
    Accounts Team</p>
</body>
</html>